---
import '../styles/operations-sections.css';
import FeatureArt from './FeatureArt.astro';
import TutorialDemo from './TutorialDemo.astro';
import WatchDemo from './WatchDemo.astro';
import { tutorialForDoc } from '../lib/tutorials';
import { terminalTutorial } from '../lib/home-tutorials';

const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
const debugDemo = tutorialForDoc('debugging')!;
---

<div class="operations-sections">
  <section class="section ops-tools" id="tools" aria-labelledby="ops-tools-title">
    <div class="container">
      <FeatureArt kind="tools" />
      <div class="ops-tools-intro">
        <div class="section-heading"><h2 id="ops-tools-title" data-chapter="04 / DEVELOPER TOOLS">OneBot 调试与终端</h2></div>
        <p>发起请求，看回包。<br />需要继续排查，就打开终端。</p>
      </div>
      <div class="ops-tool-notes">
        <p><strong>调一个接口</strong><span>搜索 get_login_info，发送请求，把结果存为收藏。</span></p>
        <p><strong>敲几条命令</strong><span>查看目录和输出，打开文件栏，再试试左右分屏。</span></p>
      </div>
      <div class="home-tool-demo">
        <TutorialDemo id="home-tools-demo" tutorial={debugDemo} showcase choices={[{ label: 'OneBot 调试台', tutorial: debugDemo }, { label: '内嵌终端', tutorial: terminalTutorial }]} />
      </div>
      <div class="demo-section-links"><span>演示数据 · 可以随时接手操作</span><a href={base + 'docs/debugging/'}>调试台指南 ↗</a><a href={base + 'docs/terminal/'}>终端指南 ↗</a></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section ops-watch" id="watch" aria-labelledby="ops-watch-title">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="ops-watch-layout">
        <div class="ops-watch-copy">
          <div class="section-heading"><h2 id="ops-watch-title" data-chapter="05 / ALWAYS IN SIGHT">远端监控</h2></div>
          <p class="ops-watch-lead">关掉 Desktop，远端也有人值守。安装并配置 ncd-watch 后，它会继续检查 Bot，并按配置发送掉线通知。</p>
          <dl class="ops-watch-features">
            <div><dt>看清运行状态</dt><dd>CPU、内存、磁盘和 Bot 指标，集中查看。</dd></div>
            <div><dt>把值守留在远端</dt><dd>自动重启与通知策略保存在远端，管理窗口无需一直开着。</dd></div>
          </dl>
          <a class="ops-watch-guide" href={base + 'docs/watch/'}>ncd-watch 使用指南 ↗</a>
        </div>
        <WatchDemo />
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</div>
